                                                    <Value EvaluationMode="Auto">This contract may be terminated by you or the Bank on the giving of 7 days' written notice without the need to assign any reason whatsoever. Should you decide to leave the service of the Bank, you will be required to give 30 days prior notice in writing.</Value>
