                                            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
                                            <Paragraphs>
                                              <Paragraph>
                                                <TextRuns>
                                                  <TextRun>
                                                    <Value EvaluationMode="Auto">Notwithstanding anything contained herein above, should there be any adverse reports about you based on references we obtain from independent sources including your previous employers, teachers, schools/colleges you attended or government agencies and/or should you be medically unfit or have pre-existing diseases which may interfere with your work or are contagious, your services in the Bank may be terminated at any time with a prior notice of seven days.</Value>
